OL,3,GNEWSACounties at odds over #1bn mayoral
OL,4,Adevolution deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo county councils are at odds over a
OL,7,F#1bn devolution deal, with one side
OL,8,Fcalling for mayoral elections sooner
OL,9,Fwhile the other wants changes before
OL,10,Fsigning anything.
OL,12,FNorfolk County Council's Reform UK
OL,13,Fleaders have already written to prime
OL,14,Fminister Andy Burnham, urging the vote
OL,15,Fto be brought forward a year to 2027.
OL,17,FBut their Reform Suffolk counterparts
OL,18,Fbelieve more time is needed to prepare,
OL,19,Fand they are also finalising a fresh
OL,20,Fdeal that aims to ensure more equal
OL,21,Ffunding between the two rival counties.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
